{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49033","headline":"武康碧落观 · 胡传美","name":"武康碧落观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙宫碧落太微书，遗蹟依然掩故居。\n幢节不归天杳邈，烟霞空锁日幽虚。\n不逢金简扳云洞，可惜瑶台叠藓除。\n欲脱儒衣陪羽客，伤心齿发已凋疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡传美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}